"CompPosit is designed as an extended version of the Posit-object
It calculates the desired output to position at the setpoint with constant acceleration.
You can define a DeadZoneOut, where Output is zero, to avoid very small output
When positioning is not on, the output is zero. Negative output to reach lower position.

It can work in manual / test mode from object screen if desired.

Positioning starts on startorder edge (or on order from object screen).

Reset will stop positioning immediately.
Switch between ManMode and auto will also stop positioning.
If the position is inside the DeadZone for a certain time, positioning will stop if TimerStopPosit is enabled.
"
